[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 903.189, "timestamp": "00:15:03", "text": "所以，呃，对于正在观看的各位来说，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 905.59, "timestamp": "00:15:05", "text": "等等，这次合作是怎么结束的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 908.15, "timestamp": "00:15:08", "text": "真的发生了吗？哦，合作活动在六月举行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 912.71, "timestamp": "00:15:12", "text": "第七。嗯，是的，下个月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 916.31, "timestamp": "00:15:16", "text": "哦，真好，真好，真好。这是计划。我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 918.91, "timestamp": "00:15:18", "text": "最近联系上了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 921.15, "timestamp": "00:15:21", "text": "他们。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 925.03, "timestamp": "00:15:25", "text": "是的。然后我就收到了这个坏消息"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 927.75, "timestamp": "00:15:27", "text": "这个叫比利比利的小玩意儿。我的白名单"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 929.55, "timestamp": "00:15:29", "text": "好像他们再也无法为我提供任何东西了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 933.91, "timestamp": "00:15:33", "text": "因为帮我进来的那个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 936.15, "timestamp": "00:15:36", "text": "不，不是那个人。是的，得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 938.949, "timestamp": "00:15:38", "text": "进去，然后和公会的人聊了聊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 941.43, "timestamp": "00:15:41", "text": "员工和其他一切。那个人离开了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 943.31, "timestamp": "00:15:43", "text": "公司年度"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 947.509, "timestamp": "00:15:47", "text": "前。我，我呃，听起来好像我必须……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 950.31, "timestamp": "00:15:50", "text": "要知道，就像最近发生的那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 953.43, "timestamp": "00:15:53", "text": "已经一年了。是的。这个人是"}]